VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'image along with the histogram. There is also a "brick" mode where you can see, for example, file names and their sizes. Film mode, and we also have a map. Right now I\'m'

[03:27] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'using one of the fairly discreet themes. Here is my night theme. But you may decide you like something more vibrant. Here we have a nice lime green option. All the'

[03:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'main modes can be easily adjusted. If I go into settings, we can switch between the tile mode and the cards mode we were just in to'

[03:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'see the file names. There is also an aligned view, which maintains the correct proportions for any photo you take. And then there\'s the "bricklaying" mode, which I was in before. I see a lot of poorly'

[04:04] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'designed and awkward interfaces. So it\'s nice to find that the Labs developer isn\'t looking to torture those who use its software. Unfortunately, the good news is n\'t limited to'

[04:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'interface design. All nine Labs sections are available in this sidebar. We are now in library mode, where all your photos appear after importing them into the app. There'

[04:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'are basic filtering options here : rating, tags, and certain topics. These general topic categories were automatically identified by the app'

[04:40] [scene:talk]
